 he wonders of science\, technology\, engineering\, and math with exciting 
 activities\, special community partners\, and immersive IMAX® films. Whet
 her you’re a budding engineer\, a lifelong learner\, or just love discov
 ering something new\, there’s something for everyone. Thanks to generous
  support from Micron\, admission is FREE for all guests! What to Expect 
 – Free admission: Explore The Tech’s interactive exhibits and discover
  your inner innovator. – Hands-on STEM labs (1 to 4 p.m.): Get creative 
 with Cabbage Paints\, explore The Physics of Roller Coasters\, and put you
 r curiosity to work. – Free IMAX® films: Experience educational films o
 n the largest dome screen in the Bay Area\, with screenings at 12:30\, 1:3
 0\, 2:30\, 3:30\, and 4:30 p.m. – Community activities and giveaways: Co
 nnect with local Silicon Valley organizations offering bonus activities\, 
 fun surprises\, and opportunities to explore STEM. Bring your family\, inv
 ite a friend\, and get ready to experiment\, play\, and discover something
  amazing together! Nationa
LOCATION:The Tech Interactive\, 201 S. Market St.\, San Jose\, CA 95113 Da
 te: Sunday\, Nov. 8
